07E3                          IF   CPM   
07E3                             ; RAM pages, after the image
07E3                CPAGE:    EQU   (imgend + 255) / 256   ; the skip cache (QK builds), first, so
07E3                RSPAGE:   EQU   CPAGE + QK   ;   that the letter page is still the one
07E3                DSPAGE:   EQU   RSPAGE + 1   ;   just below the program text
07E3                LETPAGE:   EQU   RSPAGE + 2   
07E3                PROG:     EQU   LETPAGE*256 + 256   
07E3                          ENDIF      
07E3                IMGEND:      


